# SOC L1 Alert Reporting

## Summary
The L1 reports the alert before passing it to the L2. 

## Key Concepts
- Alert Escalation - a true positive alert beiing passed to the L2.

## Report Format
- Who - which user logs in, runs command, or downloads file.
- What - what action or event sequence was preformed.
- When - when did the suspicious activity start and end.
- Where - which device, ip, or website was involved in the alert.
- Why - reasoning for the final verdict.

